<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia Air Liquide reports higher 96 net.</title>
<headline>Tunisia Air Liquide reports higher 96 net.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's liquid air L'Air Liquide net profits in 1996 amounted to 1.595 million dinars, up from 1.262 million dinars in 1995, results showed on Friday.</p>
<p>The company said it was distributing a dividend of 4.8 dinars per share, higher than 4.4 dinars in 1995.</p>
<p>The firm's share nominal price was 20 dinars. It was last priced at 184.7 dinars at the Tunis Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>($=1.1706 dinar)</p>
<p>- Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
